<!DOCTYPE html>    
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="keywords" content="完美、 软件、 游戏、 完美世界、 武林外传、 完美国际、 诛仙、 赤壁、 热舞派对、 口袋西游、 Perfect、 World、 pwrd、 software、 games、 3D、online " />
<title>您访问的页面不存在 - 完美世界</title>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=750,user-scalable=no" />
<meta name="format-detection" content="telephone=no" />
<style type="text/css">
    *{margin: 0; padding: 0;}
    body,html{width: 100%; height: 100%;}
    body{background: #f6f1e7;font-family:"Microsoft Yahei";}
    #wrap{background:url(https://static.games.wanmei.com/public/images/error.png) no-repeat 0 0; position: fixed; left: 50%; top: 50%; width: 726px; height: 370px; margin: -220px 0 0 -363px;}
    #wrap .text{text-align: center; font-size: 18px; color: #333; width: 100%; position: absolute; left: 0; bottom: 0;}
    #wrap .text span{color: #f3813c; padding: 0 5px;}
    @media only screen and (max-device-width : 750px){
        #wrap .text{font-size: 24px;}
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="wrap">
    <div class="text">无法找到您访问的地址，<span id="time">5</span>秒后跳转至<span id="pageName">完美世界</span>首页</div>
</div>
<script type="text/javascript" src="https://static.games.wanmei.com/public/js/jq_183.js"></script>
<script type="text/javascript" src="https://static.games.wanmei.com/public/js/stat.js"></script>
<script type="text/javascript">
    function id(id){return document.getElementById(id)}
    var locationUrl = document.location.hostname;
    var startTime = 5;
    setInterval(function(){
        id("time").innerHTML = --startTime;
        if(startTime == 0){
            window.location.href = "https://www.wanmei.com";
        }
    },1000);
</script>
